  "title": "Coffee Shops in Aspen | Café | MOLLIE Aspen",
  "content": "Nestled within MOLLIE, the Cafe offers Sightglass coffee, perfectly blended matcha lattes, and a variety of Rishi Select Teas. It also features a selection of prepared breakfast and pastry options, and a special lunch menu from Petit Trois. In the afternoon it transitions to a Wine Bar with snacks by Chef Ludo and an exciting wine list, including a significant number of wines by the glass.\nWhether you’re starting your day with a perfectly poured cappuccino or savoring a glass of wine after your day on the slopes, the cafe’s warm and welcoming vibe is the perfect spot to relax and connect. Seating is available for those looking to enjoy a quick bite or catch up on emails, and items can be conveniently packaged to go on your way to the slopes or the office.\nFor a more leisurely experience, sit-down dining is also available in the restaurant for breakfast, as well as on two heated outdoor terraces complete with fireplaces.\nLooking for an intimate space for an afternoon après event? The Cafe’s intimate atmosphere makes it an ideal reception space for afternoon après gatherings, complete with light bites and cocktails.",
